            "review_title": "Review at Ngon Corner",
            "review_text": "Jean Louis P\nSurat Thani, Thailand4 contributions\n0\nGood and trendy\nJan 2016 • Friends\nI went at the Ngon Corner last week with friends, the place is new, trendy decor.\nThe waiters were attentive and took care of us right away. \nMenu is in English and Vietnamese, so it was very easy for us to understand and order. The food was very good and cheap prices.\nI recommend this place to get a better experience than street food, in a contemporain ambiance.\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2016",
